    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n28996" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δύ̆σεργ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>hard to work</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕλη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>HP</u>
					5.1.1
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λίθοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Paus.
					3.21.4
				</span></i>
			; <i>unfit to be worked</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σίδηρος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Lyc.</u>
					9
				</span></i>
			; <i>hard to manage</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁπλισμός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Flam.</u>
					8
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. χρῆσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Tim.</u>
					28
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόλις - <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οτέρα</span></span>
			<i>harder to besiege</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Nic.</u>
				17
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>hard to effect, difficult</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				28.8.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.272
			</span></i> (
				Sup.
			); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόλεμος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					App.
					<u>Hisp.</u>
					63
				</span></i>
			 (
				Sup.
			); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ παραφυλάττειν τὰς ἐξόδους
				- <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ότερον</span></span>
			<i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>BJ</u>
				5.12.1
			</span></i>. Adv. -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γως</span>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, κινηθῆναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Demetr.</u>
					43
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Act.
			, <i>incapable of work, useless</i>, 
